      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "All active Python core team members are eligible to vote.",
      "source_hash": 16621469274156202773,
      "context_hash": 13956442459067825000,
      "translation": "활동 중인 모든 Python 핵심 팀 구성원은 투표할 자격이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:30.566803Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Active status is determined as described in :pep:`PEP 13 <13#membership>` and implemented via the software at `python/voters <https://github.com/python/voters>`_ [1]_.",
      "source_hash": 17519760677760407469,
      "context_hash": 1635811075689489704,
      "translation": "활동 중 상태는 :pep:`PEP 13 <13#membership>`\\ 에 설명된 대로 결정되며, `python/voters <https://github.com/python/voters>`_ [1]_\\ 의 소프트웨어를 통해 구현됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:30.566804Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Ballots will be distributed based on the `The Python Voter Roll for this election <https://github.com/python/voters/blob/master/voter-files/>`_ [1]_.",
      "source_hash": 5965265410002919664,
      "context_hash": 12341972340912197791,
      "translation": "투표용지는 이 선거의 `The Python Voter Roll for this election <https://github.com/python/voters/blob/master/voter-files/>`_ [1]_\\ 을 기준으로 배포됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:30.566804Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "While this file is not public as it contains private email addresses, the `Complete Voter Roll`_ by name will be made available when the roll is created.",
      "source_hash": 8895222127747436580,
      "context_hash": 5035895155553725228,
      "translation": "이 파일은 비공개 이메일 주소를 포함하므로 공개되지 않지만, 명부가 작성되면 `Complete Voter Roll`_\\ 이라는 이름으로 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944230Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Election Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14636875904910317783,
      "context_hash": 5871905699775747934,
      "translation": "선거 구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The election will be conducted using the `Helios Voting Service <https://heliosvoting.org>`__.",
      "source_hash": 12155305633836401860,
      "context_hash": 6703703042501557304,
      "translation": "선거는 `Helios Voting Service <https://heliosvoting.org>`__\\ 를 사용하여 실시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
