      "source_hash": 5928645120194261760,
      "context_hash": 759582769479510908,
      "translation": "답변 순서 무작위화: ``[X]``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944234Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Private: ``[X]``",
      "source_hash": 6706957759352342153,
      "context_hash": 3192289323522243535,
      "translation": "비공개: ``[X]``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944234Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Help Email Address: ``psf-election@python.org``",
      "source_hash": 3882621641688055594,
      "context_hash": 16181826744339366667,
      "translation": "도움말 이메일 주소: ``psf-election@python.org``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944234Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Voting starts at: ``December 1, 2021 00:00 UTC``",
      "source_hash": 10973808627445679004,
      "context_hash": 11176719636462782527,
      "translation": "투표 시작 시각: ``December 1, 2021 00:00 UTC``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944235Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Voting ends at: ``December 16, 2021 12:00 UTC``",
      "source_hash": 3815074118788659147,
      "context_hash": 14229676263598100644,
      "translation": "투표 종료 시각: ``December 16, 2021 12:00 UTC``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944235Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "This will create an election in which:",
      "source_hash": 5853243356611201665,
      "context_hash": 14104462409267809780,
      "translation": "다음과 같은 선거가 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944235Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Voting is not open to the public, only those on the `Voter Roll`_ may participate.",
      "source_hash": 12955082363503104037,
      "context_hash": 9435577545546581284,
      "translation": "투표는 일반에 공개되지 않으며, `Voter Roll`_\\ 에 있는 사람만 참여할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944235Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "Ballots will be emailed when voting starts.",
      "source_hash": 13123851619577654445,
      "context_hash": 3681668820020388086,
      "translation": "투표가 시작되면 투표용지가 이메일로 발송됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944235Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Candidates are presented in random order, to help avoid bias.",
      "source_hash": 14785501000558521769,
      "context_hash": 17155140882741695243,
      "translation": "편향을 방지하기 위해 후보자는 무작위 순서로 제시됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944236Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Voter identities and ballots are protected against cryptographic advances.",
      "source_hash": 8518556499718116435,
      "context_hash": 4093047784447268713,
      "translation": "유권자의 신원과 투표용지는 암호학적 발전에 대비하여 보호됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:21:32.944236Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
